            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu döngünün durduğunu nasıl biliyoruz?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_going = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_going == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Just keep swimming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  keep_going = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Just keep swimming\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>keep_going</code> değişkeni kod bloğunun içinde <code>False</code> olarak güncellenir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Döngünün durup durmadığını bilmiyoruz</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>keep_going</code> değişkeni kod bloğunun içinde <code>False</code> olarak güncellenir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki döngü <code>Just keep swimming</code> ifadesini bir kez yazdırır.</p><p><code>while</code> koşulu ikinci kez kontrol edildiğinde <code>keep_going</code> değişkeninin değeri nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"keep_going = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" keep_going == \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Just keep swimming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  keep_going = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Just keep swimming\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>False</code>, bu yüzden döngü orada biter.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>True</code>, çünkü ilk satır onu <code>True</code> olarak ayarladı.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">İkinci bir kontrol yoktur çünkü <code>keep_going</code> değişir değişmez döngü biter.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>False</code>, bu yüzden döngü orada biter.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
